abstract: >-
  Public-data calculations of model-risk-aware sub-kelvin magnetic-refrigeration
  operating fields in Na2BaCo(PO4)2, including a four-model N=18 size-transfer
  gate, a complete nine-circuit IBM Kingston entropy-correction benchmark, and
  package-demagnetization and heat-measurement specifications.
